<title>USA: D.R. Horton sets initial payout.</title>
<headline>D.R. Horton sets initial payout.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.R. Horton Inc said Monday directors have declared an initial dividend of $0.02 per share for the quarter ended December 31, payable February 13 to stockholders of record January 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
